doctype html
html(lang='en')

    head
        meta(charset='utf-8')
        meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no')
        title Chez-moi - OXBIY Projects
        link(rel='icon', type='image/x-icon', href='assets/favicon.ico')
        link(href='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.5.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css', rel='stylesheet')
        link(href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Merriweather+Sans:400,700', rel='stylesheet')
        link(href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Merriweather:400,300,300italic,400italic,700,700italic', rel='stylesheet', type='text/css')
        link(href='css/styles.css', rel='stylesheet')

    body#page-top
        nav#mainNav.navbar.navbar-expand-lg.navbar-light.fixed-top.py-3
            .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                a.navbar-brand(href='index.html')
                    img.logo(src='assets/img/logo.jpg', alt='OXBIY')
                button.navbar-toggler.navbar-toggler-right(type='button', data-bs-toggle='collapse', data-bs-target='#navbarResponsive', aria-controls='navbarResponsive', aria-expanded='false', aria-label='Toggle navigation')
                    span.navbar-toggler-icon
                #navbarResponsive.collapse.navbar-collapse
                    ul.navbar-nav.ms-auto.my-2.my-lg-0
                        li.nav-item
                            a.nav-link(href='index.html') Home

        // Project header
        header.masthead
            .container.px-4.px-lg-5.h-100
                .row.gx-4.gx-lg-5.h-100.align-items-center.justify-content-center.text-center
                    .col-lg-8.align-self-end
                        h1.text-dark.font-weight-bold Chez-moi
                        hr.divider
                    .col-lg-8.align-self-baseline
                        p.text-dark.mb-5
                            | Chez-moi is a secure property rental platform where landlords list homes and clients can view and rent properties. The platform emphasizes verification, secure booking workflows, and protections for both renters and hosts.

        // Project content
        section.page-section
            .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                h2.mb-4 Project Overview
                p.mb-4
                    | Chez-moi allows landlords to present properties with detailed listings and images, manage availability, and accept bookings. Renters can schedule visits, review property details, and complete secure transactions through the platform.

                .row.gx-4.gx-lg-5
                    .col-md-6
                        img.img-fluid(src='assets/img/portfolio/fullsize/3.jpg', alt='Chez-moi image')
                    .col-md-6
                        img.img-fluid(src='assets/img/portfolio/fullsize/4.jpg', alt='Chez-moi image')

                a.btn.btn-primary.mt-4(href='index.html') Back to Home

        // Footer
        footer.bg-light.py-5
            .container.px-4.px-lg-5.text-center
                img.footer-logo(src='assets/img/logo.jpg', alt='OXBIY')
                .small.text-center.text-muted
                    | Copyright &copy; 2023 - OXBIY

        script(src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js')
        script(src='https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/SimpleLightbox/2.1.0/simpleLightbox.min.js')
        script(src='js/scripts.js')
